WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.261 --> 00:00:03.441
- I've seen a cat take a shit
locking eyes with my roommate.

00:00:03.441 --> 00:00:06.820
Not many people can say that, so. (laughs)

00:00:06.820 --> 00:00:09.026
(light electronic music)

00:00:09.026 --> 00:00:10.896
- I have a cat and her name is Jengi.

00:00:10.896 --> 00:00:12.974
- His name is Rusty Shackleford.

00:00:12.974 --> 00:00:14.680
- My cat's name is Tails.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:15.795
- Meano.

00:00:15.795 --> 00:00:19.057
- So I missed having Harry with me

00:00:19.057 --> 00:00:22.401
so I flew him out to LA from Dallas.

00:00:22.401 --> 00:00:24.073
- And he was kinda standing near the wall,

00:00:24.073 --> 00:00:26.023
and I was petting him, and he started

00:00:26.023 --> 00:00:27.626
having a sneezing fit.

00:00:27.626 --> 00:00:29.597
- He had this problem where he

00:00:29.597 --> 00:00:30.597
(intense inquisitive music)

00:00:30.597 --> 00:00:33.352
didn't go to the bathroom
for like three days,

00:00:33.352 --> 00:00:35.469
and then he started acting like

00:00:35.469 --> 00:00:38.438
he was possessed by demons.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:41.167
- And then all of a sudden,
from the living room

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:44.706
I hear this scream, and it's my roommate.

00:00:44.706 --> 00:00:46.786
He's like, "What the fuck, dude?!"

00:00:46.786 --> 00:00:49.886
- And it just splattered
all over the wall.

00:00:49.886 --> 00:00:51.685
- Some shit flew out of his butt

00:00:51.685 --> 00:00:54.123
in liquid form onto my shirt.

00:00:54.123 --> 00:00:57.757
- "Dude, your cat fuckin'
shit all over the bean bag,

00:00:57.757 --> 00:00:59.754
and I'm eatin' Chipotle!"

00:00:59.754 --> 00:01:01.542
- I guess her tail had been under her

00:01:01.542 --> 00:01:04.561
and like her whole dump
went on top of her tail.

00:01:04.561 --> 00:01:08.230
So like three turds
were on her whole tail.

00:01:08.230 --> 00:01:11.566
- A shit longer than him

00:01:11.566 --> 00:01:16.141
came out of him, and I have
no idea how it happened.

00:01:16.141 --> 00:01:18.446
- This huge Lovesac in the living room

00:01:18.446 --> 00:01:20.669
was just drenched in diarrhea,

00:01:20.669 --> 00:01:22.087
(light orchestral music)

00:01:22.087 --> 00:01:25.530
cat diarrhea, and it just smells.

00:01:25.530 --> 00:01:28.061
It's like a shit sauna,
it's just in your face.

00:01:28.061 --> 00:01:28.920
(splatting imitation)

00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:31.045
- The sheer weight of
the poop on her tail,

00:01:31.045 --> 00:01:32.429
she couldn't handle it.

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:35.491
I don't know why she didn't
feel it happening in the midst,

00:01:35.491 --> 00:01:37.484
but there was nothing in the litter box.

00:01:37.484 --> 00:01:38.276
(music cuts out)

00:01:38.276 --> 00:01:40.842
- And then he walked away, and my roommate

00:01:40.842 --> 00:01:44.661
was like, "I think we need
to get rid of this cat.

00:01:44.661 --> 00:01:46.997
"I don't think it's working out."

00:01:46.997 --> 00:01:48.785
- And he told me, "Get rid of the cat,

00:01:48.785 --> 00:01:51.142
"the cat's gotta go or I'm gonna go."

00:01:51.142 --> 00:01:52.311
(light smooth jazz)

00:01:52.311 --> 00:01:55.133
We're not friends anymore
now, but for other issues.

00:01:55.133 --> 00:01:57.780
- I don't know, cats are cats.

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.580
- It's kind of a
sacrifice you have to make

00:01:59.580 --> 00:02:01.495
if you want a cat, you know?

00:02:01.495 --> 00:02:03.864
But I love cats so much that it's worth

00:02:03.864 --> 00:02:06.378
goin' through some shit storms.

